.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-admin-status - Display platform ownership verification status, vault integrity, and mail config


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit admin status [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Reports whether platform ownership has been verified, vault file path and permissions, and active SMTP gateway.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to configuration file

.PP
\fB-f\fP, \fB--format\fP="table"
	Output format: table or json

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status

.PP
\fB--store\fP=""
	Custom path to owner storage vault file


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit-admin(1)\fP
